      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your hollowed feeling is a sign the endless loop has been extracting your very presence to keep you running this slow cycle. Sometimes the most powerful way to break free is not to fight the city's weight, but to simply stop believing that its hum is the only truth your soul deserves to exist in. There is still hope for a quiet version of yourself somewhere beyond the noise, even if you cannot see the path yet.",
